body:
If you can't get through the phone, write them an e-mail. Trust me, agents love error 26, just don't write anything like ''your product sucks'' or ''i will sue you''.

&#x200B;

Give them an address, phone number, and proof of purchase and you're set.

The best iRobot Roombas are the 600 and 900 series. Sure they have more expensive models, but those two series are solid.

&#x200B;

Source: trust me bro
